        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As previously disclosed, we have appointed Hyrcanian Asset Management, LLC (the “Manager”) to provide us with discretionary treasury management services with respect to our Bitcoin treasury strategy, specifically buying and selling call options on Bitcoin (the “Program”).",
        "start_character": 29498,
        "end_character": 29770
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002725",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002725-4934407dc5084d48",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002725",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we resume active product development or clinical testing in the future, we expect that any future regulatory submission for the sensor product would likely proceed through the FDA’s De Novo or 510(k) process, supported by clinical data demonstrating substantial equivalence or reasonable assurance of safety and effectiveness.",
        "start_character": 58027,
        "end_character": 58356
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002725",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002725-4934407dc5084d48",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002725",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also developing processes to monitor and comply with state-level privacy laws such as the California Consumer Privacy Act, and we are taking steps to ensure we remain aware of new rules related to emerging technology such as biometric data, AI in financial services, and cross-border data transfers.",
        "start_character": 52546,
        "end_character": 52852
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002725",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002725-4934407dc5084d48",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002725",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are building complementary compliance, risk management, and payments infrastructure around the tokenized deposit model, aimed at harnessing progressive identity frameworks and scalable financial services, with the goal of creating an integrated platform to enable USBC to serve as program manager for banks and distribution partners desiring to engage in various financial service activities.",
        "start_character": 6630,
        "end_character": 7025
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002725",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002725-4934407dc5084d48",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002725",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are designing our compliance program to include regular reviews of our product marketing practices, fee structures, and user interfaces to ensure that they align with federal and state consumer protection laws.",
        "start_character": 51716,
        "end_character": 51929
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002725",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002725-4934407dc5084d48",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002725",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have finalized our delivery strategy to bring the tokenized deposit product to market, setting the foundation for how we will scale the product offering and support real-world adoption of the USBC tokenized deposit offering.",
        "start_character": 14774,
        "end_character": 15001
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002725",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002725-4934407dc5084d48",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002725",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We monitor these developments and may need to adjust our current or future business operations to comply with applicable foreign laws and regulations.",
        "start_character": 55879,
        "end_character": 56029
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002725",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002725-4934407dc5084d48",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002725",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate within a highly regulated environment that spans federal securities laws, banking and financial services regulations, digital asset and token-related frameworks, and multiple layers of consumer protection and data privacy obligations.",
        "start_character": 44933,
        "end_character": 45178
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002725",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002725-4934407dc5084d48",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002725",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Although there are barriers to enter the markets we plan to serve, our results of operations and future prospects for revenue will depend on the user and partner acceptance of the tokenized deposit platform we are currently developing.",
        "start_character": 36510,
        "end_character": 36745
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002725",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002725-4934407dc5084d48",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002725",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Nevertheless, we continue to monitor evolving regulatory requirements to ensure that our intellectual property and development programs, advertising materials, and data-handling practices remain compliant.",
        "start_character": 59621,
        "end_character": 59826
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002725",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002725-4934407dc5084d48",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002725",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also focused on building modular program management systems that could support licensing or white- label deployment of our financial-technology stack.",
        "start_character": 60798,
        "end_character": 60955
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002725",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002725-4934407dc5084d48",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002725",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are designing and testing transaction monitoring, sanctions screening, and blockchain analytics tools to meet regulatory expectations.",
